{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure, it is given that angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffb9ea254bced85582c78670aef6ad5a5c8af61c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/5/ea58009e06d0f5017cdae7d42f7c7cd1de4aa94c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD} = \\overline{DB}$\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30c3b9a9e672ed8ce093debeacc6b77559773f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE \\perp AB$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/99928baf6f2cae04600f9ad4a9b6981442e290e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB} = 20$\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e32ecc3b591d6bc9c85bb3479af72f682554c389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC} = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" />. The area of quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/5311891cede4a863f11bf7eb2c4c0d6208f951f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADEC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/3/443fde7549f310f3da05d18725232c0f573b5f8a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(7); defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)+fontsize(10pt)); pair A,B,C,D,E; A=(0,0); B=(20,0); C=(36/5,48/5); D=(10,0); E=(10,75/10); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(D--E); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,N); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,NE); draw(rightanglemark(B,D,E,30)); [/asy]\" width=\"272\" height=\"152\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fcb45d48540454036f7db2be3ac06853eab8883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 75\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 58\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 37\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"497\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5ea314f60b9f1201ff49f3392b635dbc8c906ec3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ADEC]=[BCA]-[BDE]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p>Note that, as right triangles sharing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/2918f7d23f9ee8c04baabad86100d68023ec03f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/40369ce8e0c15077061c83ebf20dc5d1d8e5450b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BDE \\sim \\triangle BCA$\" width=\"144\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71b35593ab01bf13d4a5fc64fd7f842b578c5cc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD}=\\frac{20}{2}=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"118\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Because the sides of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79c35bcb734d7ec239f0e2939d436cca06f71806.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BCA$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> are in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5c7e5ac8b9ec338aa09eca12cf8fe6d85eb4b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:4:5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f22eb06b465841395d4130444c4584842debccf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The sides of our triangles are in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a5ce34886079dd6a284c30261f3c85e04118068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{16}=\\frac{5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"58\" height=\"38\" />, and the ratio of their areas is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d57885a00f9f941e655a4211a6060d4fedd15513.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{5}{8}\\right)^2=\\frac{25}{64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"91\" height=\"46\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c3ccd38d4c44d008a442ac2ecb6233c7c93c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BCA]=\\frac{12 \\cdot 16}{2}=96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"172\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/0/b202984851a2c3c9e24c5462a8f2150218ccddf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BDE]=\\frac{96 \\cdot 25}{64}=\\frac{75}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52957d6d5a338637d53e97774fa87394e66ac9ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ADEC]=\\frac{192-75}{2}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 58\\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"265\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t